==Russian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*čьrnъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*kr̥snós||black}}. Cognates include Old Church Slavonic {{m|cu|sc=Cyrs|чрънъ|tr=črŭnŭ||black}}, Bulgarian {{m|bg|черен}}, Serbo-Croatian {{m|sh|црн}}/{{m|sh|crn}}, Slovene {{m|sl|črn}}, Slovak {{m|sk|čierny}}; Norwegian and Swedish {{m|sv|harr||grayling}}, Sanskrit {{m|sa|कृष्ण|sc=Deva}}, Old Prussian {{m|prg|kirsnan||black}}.

